[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":59},["ShallowReactive",2],{"/zh/blog/tag/git-lfs":3},[4],{"_path":5,"_dir":6,"_draft":7,"_partial":7,"_locale":8,"title":9,"description":8,"date":10,"tags":11,"body":15,"_type":53,"_id":54,"_source":55,"_file":56,"_stem":57,"_extension":58},"/zh/blog/no-git-lfs","blog",false,"","不推荐对网站项目使用git lfs","2025-07-14 16:22",[12,13,14],"git","tool","git-lfs",{"type":16,"children":17,"toc":50},"root",[18],{"type":19,"tag":20,"props":21,"children":22},"element","ul",{},[23,30,35,40,45],{"type":19,"tag":24,"props":25,"children":26},"li",{},[27],{"type":28,"value":29},"text","网站项目如react, next, vue, nuxt, 一般会包含一些图片文件, 如logo, 但是不会太多.",{"type":19,"tag":24,"props":31,"children":32},{},[33],{"type":28,"value":34},"使用git lfs后, 只使用git clone拉取项目到服务器, 可能会发现图片损坏.",{"type":19,"tag":24,"props":36,"children":37},{},[38],{"type":28,"value":39},"当然你可以尝试使用git lfs pull等命令修复, 但是在服务器上操作不如本地方便.",{"type":19,"tag":24,"props":41,"children":42},{},[43],{"type":28,"value":44},"我把nuxt网站项目部署到服务器, 发现图片损坏. 使用git lfs pull后, 发现访问图片已经在服务器上存在, 但通过url访问时png图片时, 获得的是一张一样宽高但完全透明的没有内容的图片.",{"type":19,"tag":24,"props":46,"children":47},{},[48],{"type":28,"value":49},"不使用git lfs可以节约你的生命.",{"title":8,"searchDepth":51,"depth":51,"links":52},2,[],"markdown","content:zh:blog:979.no-git-lfs.md","content","zh/blog/979.no-git-lfs.md","zh/blog/979.no-git-lfs","md",1760095630420]